{
  "name": "ColorMe Toon — توليد صفحات التلوين (Nano Banana)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ColorMe Toon (Nano Banana 2.1)\n1. **Webhook**: بيستقبل الطلب من الموقع بعد الدفع (محمي بـ Header Auth).\n2. بيحمّل صورة الطفل.\n3. بيقسم الطلب لـ 10 صفحات (برومبت لكل صفحة) ومعاها صورة الطفل base64.\n4. **Gemini (Nano Banana 2.1)** بيرسم كل صفحة من صورة الطفل + البرومبت.\n5. بيطلّع الصورة من الرد ويبعتها للموقع. الموقع بيقفل الطلب لوحده لما يوصل 10.\n\n**Credentials:** Header Auth account (Webhook و Send page)، و Gemini API key (Header Auth باسم x-goog-api-key) في Generate page.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "a1f1c0de-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        -140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "colorme-toon",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1f1c0de-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        200
      ],
      "webhookId": "5c0f6d0e-9b0a-4c55-9a40-c010e7007002"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.body.photoUrl }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file",
              "outputPropertyName": "photo"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "a1f1c0de-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Download child photo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        200
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// بيحوّل الطلب لـ 10 عناصر: عنصر لكل صفحة، ومعاه صورة الطفل\nconst order = $('Webhook').first().json.body;\nconst photo = $input.first().binary.photo;\nconst photoB64 = (await this.helpers.getBinaryDataBuffer(0, 'photo')).toString('base64');\nconst photoMime = photo.mimeType || 'image/jpeg';\nconst count = order.imagesCount || 10;\nconst prompts = (order.suggestedPrompts || []).slice(0, count);\n\n// لو العميل كتب ملاحظات (حيوان أليف، لون الشعر...) نضيفها لكل برومبت\nconst extra = order.notes ? ` Extra details from the parent (may be Arabic, translate them): ${order.notes}` : '';\nconst likeness = ' Keep the child\\'s face, hairstyle and features recognizable from the reference photo, but drawn as a simple cartoon. Output must be pure black outlines on a white background, no color, no gray, suitable for printing on A4.';\n\nreturn prompts.map((p, i) => ({\n  json: {\n    orderId: order.orderId,\n    callbackUrl: order.callbackUrl,\n    page: i + 1,\n    prompt: p + likeness + extra,\n    photoMime,\n    photoB64,\n  },\n}));"
      },
      "id": "a1f1c0de-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Split into 10 pages",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-nano-banana-2.1:generateContent",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ contents: [{ parts: [ { text: $json.prompt }, { inline_data: { mime_type: $json.photoMime, data: $json.photoB64 } } ] }], generationConfig: { responseModalities: ['IMAGE'], imageConfig: { aspectRatio: '3:4' } } }) }}",
        "options": {
          "batching": {
            "batch": {
              "batchSize": 2,
              "batchInterval": 2000
            }
          },
          "timeout": 240000
        }
      },
      "id": "a1f1c0de-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Generate page (Nano Banana)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        200
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "toBinary",
        "sourceProperty": "b64",
        "binaryPropertyName": "image",
        "options": {
          "fileName": "=page-{{ $('Split into 10 pages').item.json.page }}.png",
          "mimeType": "={{ $json.mime }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "a1f1c0de-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Base64 to image",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.convertToFile",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1320,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Split into 10 pages').item.json.callbackUrl }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "multipart-form-data",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "orderId",
              "value": "={{ $('Split into 10 pages').item.json.orderId }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "append",
              "value": "true"
            },
            {
              "parameterType": "formBinaryData",
              "name": "images",
              "inputDataFieldName": "image"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1f1c0de-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Send page to site",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1540,
        200
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "// بيطلّع الصورة من رد Gemini\nconst parts = ($json.candidates?.[0]?.content?.parts) || [];\nconst img = parts.find(p => p.inlineData || p.inline_data);\nif (!img) throw new Error('Nano Banana مارجعش صورة: ' + JSON.stringify($json).slice(0, 500));\nconst d = img.inlineData || img.inline_data;\nreturn { json: { b64: d.data, mime: d.mimeType || d.mime_type || 'image/png' } };"
      },
      "id": "a1f1c0de-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "Extract image",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        200
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Download child photo",
